    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "moon samir",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112950744034751820387/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzLsDI-Wme-Rc7lHTLXxlwDvujqORWPcfAYkqVhxwo88gdw8Yz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Price is good there and they have variety of items. You can find kitchen's stuff, carpets, curtains, cushoins,  some furniture, cloth section and many other items. Recommend to visit it.",
        "time": 1615479096,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rebecca Dyer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113945681125220828245/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXFNBeXEgIPDIbnBopYP3ZVBzHTs2WfH206ZSXab_dY4rIqpTM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The best quality jeans I have ever purchased, that have lasted me years I purchased from this Hart store, it's wonderful to dig through those racks and find exactly my size women's jeans. Other stores now when I look through the items I need I end up having to buy it online anyway because they simply don't carry it in stock, not the case for Hart!\n\nI have found my nicest bedding here , and they even carry real LuLu Lemon items at a fraction of the cost . Sadly it's in a very slow mall with very little traffic, there is always something amazing to find here.\n\nNot a paid add, I just adore this store.",
        "time": 1729084609,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dolly Tohme",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114037877458364037446/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWsDMzVhf_RPhBJwZzz5vKDclM1lvfQ4_xz3IH57yiVIruxgpGm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "You will be surprised by the findings of known labels. If you like to go for clothes hunting, they get on regular basics big bins of stock from known clothing stores with reduced tags... worthy.\n\nIf you are a student on a budget, this is the place to furnish you little space... they have everything...",
        "time": 1672752273,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A Guzzo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114211370947836360517/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIeFX8PpXJI-o1J-Sky22KlPurE2YqbqZVb1YQV23nE9-j5PA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Wanted to buy a bathing suit but couldn't try it on because the changing rooms are closed!! So then I asked if I could return it if it doesn't fit, they said no. The changing rooms are closed for about 1 week they said! How can anybody buy clothes without trying first??? And why does it take a week to fix the room??? Pretty bad service.........",
        "time": 1686771415,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Santino Domingo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117842291429756467376/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUwMTTu5DnrVJU7F3y-HCv3T9dA-HsCC73Rtq1GvwD-COesBkyDFQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "Came here for weekend sale on a mattress. Didn't have my size in stock. I asked if he new of another location that has what I am looking for. He gets a flyer and tells me here are the numbers of the other store locations and for me to call them. Really? Why can't he just called wherever and order me one. Nope, can't do that. Oh well, I will just have to keep looking.",
        "time": 1485750825,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
